      "title": "StreamRule",
      "description": "A program that is a filter when it has no file operand (§ 6.2 step 5). The first `operands_before_files` positionals are no file (a pattern, a script), unless one of `pattern_flags` gave the pattern (`grep -e x f`).",
      "x-ess-name": "shellspec.classification.StreamRule",
      "x-ess-kind": "struct",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
